 "steps": [
  {
   "id": "s0",
   "title": "Unit vectors î and ĵ",
   "text": "**î** and **ĵ** are vectors of length 1 along +x and +y. They only show direction: they have no unit.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 1,
      "a": 3,
      "b": 4
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s1",
   "title": "Position vector",
   "text": "The **position vector** of P({{a|0}}, {{b|0}}) points from the origin to P. In components \\( \\vec r = a\\hat i + b\\hat j \\), and its length is \\( r = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} = {{r|2}} \\).",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 2
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s2",
   "title": "Unit vector of r",
   "text": "Divide a vector by its own length to get a vector of length 1 in the same direction: \\( \\hat r = \\vec r / r = ({{ux|2}}, {{uy|2}}) \\).",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3
     },
     "at": 0
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s3",
   "title": "Move P about",
   "text": "Drag the sliders: r̂ turns with r but its length stays exactly 1.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "a": -4,
      "b": 3
     },
     "at": 0,
     "dur": 2800
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s4",
   "title": "The null vector",
   "text": "If P is the origin the vector has zero length and no direction: the **null vector**. Its unit vector does not exist.",
   "actions": [
    {
     "set": {
      "lv": 3
     },
     "at": 0
    },
    {
     "tween": {
      "a": 0,
      "b": 0
     },
     "at": 0,
     "dur": 2600
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
