 "takeaways": [
  "**Position vector** of P(a, b): r = a î + b ĵ, r = √(a² + b²).",
  "**Unit vector**: r̂ = r / r, magnitude 1, no unit.",
  "**Null vector**: zero magnitude, arbitrary direction."
 ]
